<!--
  DRS privacy hardening (S-9): the keyboard stores typed text derivatives
  (user dictionary, learned words, clipboard history, per-app profile data)
  inside its private sandbox. None of that may ever leave the device via
  the platform cloud-backup or device-to-device transfer (Android 12+
  data extraction rules), so cloud backup is disabled in the manifest
  (android:allowBackup="false") and this rule set is intentionally EMPTY
  (no include/cloud-backup/device-to-device-transfer elements = nothing
  eligible, belt-and-braces). See PRIVACY.md for the full data policy.
-->
<data-extraction-rules />
